      "source_prompt": "Create ONE compact inventory icon for the A-Discord grounded science-fiction strategy game. Match the reference's painted realistic game-asset rendering, muted olive/khaki cloth, dark charcoal metal, small warm metal accents, fine fabric texture, practical construction. Single clearly readable object grouping centered, 3/4 view, soft upper-left light, distinct thin near-black outline. Occupy 80% of a square canvas with ample empty margins. Designed to remain clear at 72x72 pixels. No person, no mannequin, no lettering, no logo, no frame, no floor or cast ground shadow. Genuine transparent background; if alpha is unavailable use perfectly flat pure magenta #ff00ff background, never a checkerboard or white background. Do not reproduce the whole reference sheet. Subject: a folded and loosely draped multispectral camouflage cape with a small shoulder hood, a broad recognizable sheet of soft olive and desaturated brown woven fabric, subtle irregular camouflage blocks, one exposed silvery thermal liner corner. Flexible cloth, no rigid armour, no glowing circuits."
